                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "(i have played every PCM from 2009)\nOh boy, this is hard to say good or bad too.\n\nIn one way, it's a improvement with the new Pro Cyclist mode, which is quite cool..... when you leave the bugs out.\n\nI mean, there's still bugs from the old versions...\n\nBut if its your first PCM - buy it. If you know cycling, because else you will not know what the fuck you're doing.\nIf you've played PCM before, the only reason you should have to buy PCM 2015 is the pro cyclist mode.\n\nTo be honest, almost nothing has changed. A shit game if you're not interested in cycling, mediocre+ if you're like cycling and like the pcm series.\n\nAlternatives?\nThere is none.. PCM has a monopoly in this kind of game, and therefore it's sadly the only choice. Is it a good choice? Kind of.\n\nIf i were to give this game a rating, i would rate it 6/10",
